01:44:50.800 --> 01:44:51.720
Hey...

01:44:52.430 --> 01:44:54.640
Ran-neechan, I was wondering...

01:44:55.100 --> 01:45:00.140
How did you know I didn't have a mini-air tank back there?

01:45:02.810 --> 01:45:06.110
Because you're just like that guy.

01:45:08.030 --> 01:45:10.070
I think it was when I was in eight grade,

01:45:10.700 --> 01:45:14.530
and there was a sudden rainstorm after school...

01:45:22.170 --> 01:45:23.880
Why'd this have to happen now...?

01:45:24.750 --> 01:45:26.000
Here, take this.

01:45:28.590 --> 01:45:30.590
You have to hurry back home, right?

01:45:30.840 --> 01:45:32.970
Yeah... thanks.

01:45:33.340 --> 01:45:34.510
But what about you?

01:45:34.970 --> 01:45:37.890
Stupid, I'm a detective!

01:45:37.890 --> 01:45:40.220
I already knew it was going to rain,

01:45:41.890 --> 01:45:43.980
so I brought an extra umbrella with me in this.

01:45:44.230 --> 01:45:45.560
Really?

01:45:45.560 --> 01:45:48.570
Thank goodness. I couldn't be late for my meeting with my mom.

01:45:48.570 --> 01:45:49.860
I'll be borrowing this umbrella then!

01:45:50.110 --> 01:45:51.280
I'll give it back to you tomorrow!

01:45:51.320 --> 01:45:52.030
Okay!

01:45:53.450 --> 01:45:57.410
But, I found out later that
 Shinichi didn't really bring an extra umbrella.

01:45:58.370 --> 01:46:01.450
He got drenched walking home, and ended up catching a cold.

01:46:02.750 --> 01:46:03.870
That's right,

01:46:03.870 --> 01:46:06.380
You reminded me of Shinichi at that time.

01:46:07.460 --> 01:46:08.800
You're stubborn,

01:46:08.800 --> 01:46:11.130
just like that stupid detective freak!

01:46:15.130 --> 01:46:17.720
Well, excuse me for being stupid...
